  "172": {
    "inputs": {
      "text": "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the complete ancient Chinese river landscape scene from <Picture 1>, featuring a wide calm river, distant misty mountains, traditional village houses with grey roofs, and a sandy bank with sparse vegetation.\n<Subject 2> is the central scholar figure in <Picture 1>, wearing a blue headband, light green outer robe, and beige trousers, holding a white feather fan while seated in a wooden cart.\n<Subject 3> is the group of attendants in <Picture 1>, including a man in a dark grey robe pushing the cart from behind and two men in red robes with spears standing on the right bank.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video animates <Picture 1> into a dynamic scene where <Subject 2> observes the river while <Subject 3> moves the wooden cart along the shore of <Subject 1>.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2]): fully_preserved - the river, mountains, village houses, and bank environment are retained with subtle water movement.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2]): fully_preserved - the scholar's appearance, blue headband, green robe, and feather fan are maintained throughout the motion.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2]): fully_preserved - the attendants' clothing, dark grey and red robes, and their positions relative to the cart are preserved.\n\ndetailed_description:\n目标视频呈现一种古典水墨动画风格，色彩柔和且带有细腻的笔触质感。\n[Shot 1] 画面从<Subject 1>的全景构图开始，宽阔平静的河流占据画面中心，远处山峦在薄雾中若隐若现，河岸两侧分布着古朴的村落房屋。<Subject 2>坐在木制马车的车厢内，他头戴蓝色发带，身着浅绿色长袍，右手轻握白色羽毛扇抵在下巴处，神情沉静地凝视着前方水面。在他身后，<Subject 3>中的灰袍侍从正推着车轮缓慢前行，右侧河岸上两名红袍持矛护卫静静伫立。镜头以极缓慢的速度向右平移，模拟马车移动的视角，河水表面泛起细微的涟漪，岸边的芦苇随风轻轻摇曳。\n[Shot 2] At 00:05.000, 镜头平滑地推近至<Subject 2>的中景特写。<Subject 2>微微转动头部，目光在河面与远方山峦间游移，手中的羽毛扇随之轻微晃动，展现出一种从容的领袖气质。背景中的河流和山脉因焦点转换而呈现柔和的虚化效果，增强了画面的空间层次感。此时<Subject 3>依然保持在马车后方，随着镜头的推进，灰袍侍从推车的动作显得更加连贯有力。整个画面维持着古典插画的视觉基调，光影过渡自然，营造出宁静致远的氛围。\n\noverall_soundscape:\n环境音以轻柔的水流声和远处隐约的风声为主，伴随车轮在沙石地面上滚动的细微摩擦声，整体氛围宁静且充满古意。\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\n一段缓慢而悠扬的笛声旋律作为背景音乐，节奏舒缓，带有淡淡的古典意境，音量控制在背景层次，不干扰画面的静谧感。",
